[00:35:04.442] Browser LOG     Binding products. Profile: {"about":"- Tech Lead & Senior Full-Stack Engineer with 15 years of deep hands-on experience delivering high-impact, scalable applications across fintech, education, collaboration, workforce management, and Product development.\n- Proven track record of: Transforming legacy monoliths into modern microservices (Java/Spring Boot + NextJS/React); Cutting database query times by 70%, fixing OWASP Top 10 vulnerabilities, and hardening security; Shipping 20+ complex projects end-to-end — on time, within budget, with clean code and robust CI/CD.\n- Building real-time systems with Kafka, WebRTC, payment gateways, and cloud platforms (AWS, Azure, GCP); Mentored developers, drove code reviews, and fostered best practices in Agile environments.\n- Core strengths: Java | Spring Boot | Microservices | Hibernate/JPA | Kafka | Node.js | React | Angular | MySQL | PostgreSQL | MongoDB | Docker | Kubernetes | Jenkins | REST APIs | Redis | Security & Performance Tuning.\n- Currently available for remote contract roles as Team Lead or Senior/Lead or Individual Contributor.","actionRecommendation":"Call Mahavir today citing Mars' $2B trigger—open with Situation question on hiring scale. Qualify pain on expansions, demo recruitment module live. Close with 14-day pilot to lock commitment before Q1 budget freeze.","allSkills":["Microservices","Spring Boot","Java","React.js","Amazon Web Services (AWS)","Custom Software Development","Application Development","Web Development","IT Consulting","Software Testing","Cloud Application Development","Hibernate/JPA","Kafka","Node.js","Angular","MySQL","PostgreSQL","MongoDB","Docker","Kubernetes","Jenkins","REST APIs","Redis","Security & Performance Tuning"],"availability":null,"certifications":[],"city":null,"connections":null,"conversationStarters":[{"cialdini":"Authority","label":"Situation Question","text":"With Mars dropping $2B on U.S. manufacturing and 500 new jobs by 2026, how's M&M gea